 :actor/purpose "Datafies, from PUBLIC information, the WORLDWIDE annual MAGNITUDE and GROWTH of computing capacity across four domains: STORAGE (HDD + SSD exabytes shipped), MEMORY (DRAM + NAND market revenue + bit-shipment growth), GPU/CPU (discrete-GPU + client-CPU units shipped, datacenter-accelerator revenue) and COMPUTE/FLOPS (TOP500 aggregate Rmax, frontier-model training compute), plus DATACENTER total power capacity. Reads public headline figures + open datasets only (WSTS/SIA semiconductor sales, TrendForce DRAM/NAND, IDC HDD/SSD, JPR GPU, TOP500 public list, Epoch AI CC-BY, Our World in Data CC-BY) into the kotoba Datom log as :compute.obs/*, then computes the annual increase (年間増加量) — YoY + CAGR — and coverage-honest domain aggregates. The industry-aggregate sibling of kanjō 勘定 (per-company 決算) and the demand-side counterpart of the silicon actors (handotai / iwakura / fuigo). Feeds measured actuals to mitooshi 見通し (the forecaster) but NEVER forecasts itself. NON-ADJUDICATING + PLANNING-LENS (sizes the compute commons, never a country/company ranking or an export-control / targeting list) + NO investment advice. Paid market-research terminals (Bloomberg / Gartner / IDC-report / Omdia / S&P / Statista-Pro) PROHIBITED per Charter Rider §2(e) anti-gatekeeping + §2(c): read the press release, never the terminal."
 :actor/non-goals ["N1 — NOT a forecaster (future projection is mitooshi 見通し; kasa records measured/estimated actuals)." "N2 — NOT a market-research vendor / no paywalled report or terminal redistribution." "N3 — NOT investment advice / 投資判断 (no buy/sell, no targets)." "N4 — NOT an export-control / sanctions / targeting list (planning lens, not a weapon)." "N5 — NOT per-company financials (that is kanjō 勘定) — kasa is industry/world aggregate capacity." "N6 — NOT a chip benchmark (individual silicon benchmarking is e7m bench / baien)." "N7 — NOT a country ranking / dominance verdict (non-adjudicating, G2)." "N8 — NOT real-time / per-transaction data (annual cadence, public-source bound)."]
